+# Decision log
+
+## 2026-10-28: Long-rental discount
+
+- **Context:** Customers should receive a lower price for staying longer, and quotes and bookings must
+  show the same reduced total.
+- **Decision:** Apply a 10% discount to the full rental price when the whole-day rental period is at
+  least three days. Round the discounted euro-cent amount to the nearest cent. Quotes remain the source
+  of the total used by bookings.
+- **Consequences:** Both quote and booking totals use the discount. Shorter rentals keep the full price.
+  Discounted totals remain integer euro cents.
